      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p><strong>Minor Mental Mutation</strong></p><p>You gain the ability to, by touching a person or object, receive visions, sensations and even other people's thoughts, from events that the person or object has been part of. You gain permanent access to the Psychometry Skill (as described in Winds of Magic page 47). You also gain +10 Advances in that skill per level of this mutation. You gain 1 @Condition[Fatigued] Condition if you are not wearing gloves while not actively scrying, due to the general assault of sensations.</p>"
